.TH OOMCP 1 "October 2026" "openOODA-tools v0.2.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
oomcp \- sovereign Model Context Protocol composite gateway and tool router
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B oomcp
[\fBCOMMAND\fR] [\fBOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B oomcp
is the sovereign Model Context Protocol (MCP) composite gateway and tool router for the openOODA userland suite. It provides a single, unified JSON-RPC 2.0 stdio server that aggregates all installed openOODA tools (e.g., oodiff, oogrep, oojq, oofind, oocat, ootop, oops, oocurl, oowatch, oosh), exposes their schemas to AI coding agents, and dispatches capability-bounded tool calls under strict security boundaries.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B serve
Run bidirectional Model Context Protocol JSON-RPC 2.0 server over standard input and output (default mode).
.TP
.B list
Inspect host execution paths ($PATH, ~/.openooda/bin, /usr/bin) and output an interactive status table of discovered openOODA userland tools.
.TP
.B schema
Dump aggregated JSON Schema array of all registered openOODA tool capabilities.
.TP
.B call \fITOOL\fR \fIJSON_ARGS\fR
Execute a specific tool call directly from the command line with raw JSON arguments.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-theme= NAME
Override the active oote color palette (\fBclassic\fR, \fB1982\fR, \fBdracula\fR, \fBnord\fR, \fBcyberpunk\fR).
.TP
.B \-\-mcp
Explicit alias for \fBserve\fR mode.
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Display commandline summary and exit.
.TP
.B \-v, \-\-version
Output version information and exit.
.SH AI AGENT CONFIGURATION
To configure \fBoomcp\fR in Claude Desktop, Cursor, Antigravity, or Syntrop:
.PP
.RS
.nf
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "openooda": {
      "command": "oomcp",
      "args": ["serve"]
    }
  }
}
.fi
.RE
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B OODA_THEME
Override the default 39-token semantic theme palette.
.TP
.B OODA_HOME
Override base directory for openOODA configuration (~/.openooda).
